diff --git a/README.md b/README.md
index ae56610..ad34d84 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -16,6 +16,9 @@ Mangrok is a local-first AI culinary discovery lab, private recipe vault, and il
 - Recipe origin, story, creator, place, year, and current custodian.
 - Explainable Alchemy Lab with ingredient, equipment, heat, timing, technique, risk, flavor, science, and recipe-evolution analysis.
 - Optional WebLLM and self-hosted Ollama/OpenAI-compatible refinement without committing model weights.
+- Versioned global ingredient knowledge catalog with 4,301 canonical ingredients, 5,542 aliases, 80 cuisine/tradition filters, provenance, plant-part, process, form, allergen, and dietary facets.
+- Personal ingredient memory and a moderated community-submission workflow; users cannot publish their own proposals as shared facts.
+- Hermes-inspired culinary-agent runtime with explicit intent routing, on-demand skills, bounded tools, session traces, and opt-in memory that rejects credentials, sealed notes, and complete private recipes.
 - Server-ready Alchemy entitlements, idempotent usage events, failed-call refunds, and private experiment history.
 - 6 × 9 inch print studio with cover, dedication, contents, five themes, generated culinary art, irreversible-secret confirmation, and downloadable preflight manifests.
 - Settings-based production readiness checks for browser capabilities, local AI, cloud activation, entitlements, storage, offline control, and printing.
@@ -28,7 +31,7 @@ Mangrok is a local-first AI culinary discovery lab, private recipe vault, and il
 
 The repository is application-complete, but three external activations cannot be fabricated in source code:
 
-1. **Cloud accounts and Alchemy:** create a Supabase project, apply migrations `001`, `002`, and `003`, deploy the updated Alchemy function, configure email authentication, and place only the public URL and anonymous key in `runtime-config.js`.
+1. **Cloud accounts and Alchemy:** create a Supabase project, apply migrations `001`, `002`, `003`, and `004`, deploy the updated Alchemy function, configure email authentication, and place only the public URL and anonymous key in `runtime-config.js`.
 2. **Physical books:** configure a real print provider, private PDF-proof pipeline, commercial terms, tax/shipping rules, and provider secrets in Edge Function environment variables.
 3. **Legacy release:** establish trained human reviewers, identity-verification procedures, legal review, and an auditable decision process. The supplied function only flags plans for review.
 
@@ -55,7 +58,7 @@ The deployable site is written to `dist/`. GitHub Pages builds and publishes tha
 
 1. Create a Supabase project.
 2. Apply `supabase/migrations/001_platform.sql` once to a clean project.
-3. Apply `supabase/migrations/002_alchemy.sql` and `003_alchemy_production.sql`.
+3. Apply `supabase/migrations/002_alchemy.sql`, `003_alchemy_production.sql`, and `004_global_ingredient_agent_memory.sql`.
 4. Deploy `print-order`, `legacy-review`, and `alchemy-ai` Edge Functions.
 5. Configure function secrets from the supplied `.env.example` files. The Alchemy function requires a server-only service-role key for refund/completion bookkeeping; never expose it to the browser.
 6. Copy the project URL and **anonymous** key into `runtime-config.js`.
diff --git a/assets/css/alchemy.css b/assets/css/alchemy.css
index 1b15982..223dbdc 100644
--- a/assets/css/alchemy.css
+++ b/assets/css/alchemy.css
@@ -509,3 +509,43 @@ body.food-night .mobile-more-sheet{background:#27202a}
   .alchemy-mobile-actionbar>span{font-size:7px}
   .mobile-more-sheet{padding-inline:14px}
 }
+
+/* Global ingredient knowledge, agent routing, and opt-in memory. */
+.alchemy-library-summary,.kitchen-library-summary{margin:8px 0 12px;color:var(--muted);font-size:10px;line-height:1.45}
+.alchemy-agent-trace{display:grid;gap:14px}
+.alchemy-agent-trace>div:first-child p:last-child{margin:6px 0 0;color:var(--muted)}
+.alchemy-agent-skills{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:7px}
+.alchemy-agent-skills span{padding:6px 9px;color:var(--food-berry);background:rgba(140,83,123,.08);border:1px solid rgba(140,83,123,.2);border-radius:999px;font-size:9px;font-weight:800}
+.alchemy-agent-trace ol{display:grid;gap:7px;margin:0;padding:0;list-style:none}
+.alchemy-agent-trace li{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;padding:9px 10px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.42);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px}
+.alchemy-agent-trace li b{text-transform:capitalize}
+.alchemy-agent-trace li span{color:var(--muted);font-size:9px}
+.agent-memory-panel,.ingredient-knowledge-panel{grid-column:span 2;display:grid;gap:14px}
+.agent-panel-heading{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:space-between;gap:18px}
+.agent-panel-heading h3{margin:3px 0 0}
+.agent-panel-heading .switch-row.compact{width:min(380px,100%);margin:0;padding:0;border:0}
+.agent-memory-form{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(170px,.7fr) minmax(260px,2fr);gap:12px;align-items:end}
+.agent-memory-form .wide{grid-column:2}
+.agent-memory-form .check-row{grid-column:1}
+.agent-memory-form>button{grid-column:2;justify-self:start}
+.agent-memory-list,.ingredient-proposal-list{display:grid;gap:8px}
+.agent-memory-list article,.ingredient-proposal-list article{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:space-between;gap:14px;padding:12px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.42);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px}
+.agent-memory-list article>div,.ingredient-proposal-list article>div{min-width:0}
+.agent-memory-list article span,.ingredient-proposal-list article p{color:var(--food-berry);font-size:9px;font-weight:850;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.08em}
+.agent-memory-list article p,.ingredient-proposal-list article p{margin:5px 0;overflow-wrap:anywhere}
+.agent-memory-list article small,.ingredient-proposal-list article small{color:var(--muted)}
+.ingredient-catalog-stats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(5,minmax(0,1fr));gap:8px}
+.ingredient-catalog-stats div{min-width:0;padding:10px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.42);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:13px}
+.ingredient-catalog-stats small{display:block;color:var(--muted);font-size:8px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.08em}
+.ingredient-catalog-stats b{display:block;margin-top:4px;overflow-wrap:anywhere;font-size:13px}
+.kitchen-community-check[hidden]{display:none!important}
+body.food-night .alchemy-agent-trace li,body.food-night .agent-memory-list article,body.food-night .ingredient-proposal-list article,body.food-night .ingredient-catalog-stats div{background:rgba(255,255,255,.04)}
+
+@media(max-width:940px){
+  .agent-memory-panel,.ingredient-knowledge-panel{grid-column:auto}
+  .agent-panel-heading{display:grid}
+  .agent-panel-heading .switch-row.compact{width:100%}
+  .agent-memory-form{grid-template-columns:1fr}
+  .agent-memory-form .wide,.agent-memory-form .check-row,.agent-memory-form>button{grid-column:auto}
+  .ingredient-catalog-stats{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}
+}
